# CASE Spec Template

Purpose:
  Template for CASE (business capability) specifications.
  Replaces the legacy 3-file format (spec/tasks/status) with a single .sdd file.

Owns: templates\_sdd\project\case.template.sdd

## Header

Spec: {CASE_NAME}               # Placeholder: CASE_NAME - business capability identifier
Case: {CASE_ID}                 # Placeholder: CASE_ID - unique case identifier
Module: {MODULE_ID}             # Placeholder: MODULE_ID - parent module identifier
Layer: {layer}                  # Placeholder: layer - deployment layer (L0-L4)
Status: draft|approved|in_progress|completed|blocked

## Ownership

Owns:
  ./{case_file}.go
  ./{case_file}_test.go

## Requirements

Must:
  {acceptance criteria from MASTER_PROMPT}

Forbids:
  {dependencies this case must not touch}

## Tasks

Tasks:
  [ ] #1 {task title}
  [ ] #2 {task title}

## Completion Criteria

Done when:
  BDD scenarios are covered by tests.
  Security-review has no critical/high findings.
  Ultra-review has no architecture boundary violations.

## Behavior

Scenario: {BDD scenario name}
  Given {condition}
  When {action}
  Then {result}

## Lifecycle

Created_At: <timestamp>
Updated_At: <timestamp>

State: +
